sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Developer / Repository Owner
    participant A as Coding Agent
    participant Skills as Peer Skills
    participant CLI as CoreBase SpecHarness CLI
    participant Routes as Context Routes
    participant Session as Session State
    participant Features as Feature Artifacts
    participant Memory as Durable Memory

    U->>A: Request feature or maintenance work
    A->>Skills: Select and read the named SKILL.md
    A->>CLI: skill-enter(skill, feature, intent)
    CLI->>Routes: Resolve named route and compile bounded context
    CLI->>Features: Create status.md if needed and write enter token
    CLI->>Session: Create or resume session.md
    CLI-->>A: Selected and omitted context details
    A->>Session: Read objective, progress, and handoff updates

    loop Per ready T-NNN task
        A->>CLI: task-check(feature)
        A->>CLI: task-start(feature, task: T-NNN)
        CLI->>Features: Mark T-NNN In Progress in tasks.md
        A->>A: Modify project source and run planned proof
        A->>CLI: task-done(feature, task: T-NNN, evidence)
        CLI->>Features: Mark T-NNN Done, record proof, sync tasks.json
        A->>CLI: session-checkpoint with progress or handoff
        CLI->>Session: Append resumable update
    end

    A->>Skills: Run /harness-verify
    A->>CLI: skill-enter(skill: harness-verify, feature)
    Skills->>CLI: verify(feature, skill: harness-verify)
    CLI-->>Skills: Mechanical findings and advisory/blocking result
    Skills->>Features: Write review.md and apply evidence judgment

    alt Verification passes and details.verified is true
        Skills->>Features: Write ## Post-Ship Sync in session-extracts.md
        Skills->>CLI: skill-exit(skill: harness-verify, handoff: context-memory)
        CLI->>Features: Set status.md phase to Done
        Skills->>Memory: Run /context-memory
        Memory->>Features: Triage session-extracts.md and promote supported lessons
        A->>CLI: session-end with next-action handoff
        CLI->>Session: Append final handoff and retain session.md
        A-->>U: Done verdict and evidence summary
    else Verification fails, requests changes, or advisory verified: false
        Skills->>CLI: skill-exit(skill: harness-verify, phase: ChangesRequested, handoff: spec-implement)
        CLI->>Features: Update status.md and reopen tasks or plan
        A->>CLI: session-checkpoint with blocker and next action
        CLI->>Session: Preserve resumable handoff
        A-->>U: Findings and correction path
    end

    Note over A,Memory: Installed paths are project-local. kit/ is used only while installing or maintaining the source package.
